  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "A committee of 5 out of $6+4=10$ can be made in ${ }^{10} \\mathrm{C}_{5}=252$ ways. If no woman is to be included, thennumber of ways $={ }^{5} \\mathrm{C}_{5}=6$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ the required number $=252-6=246$",
